Error [E0332]: `Fire` is a group, not a value
  --> tests/ui/enum_group_value.jet:7:25
    |
  7 |     d: Damage := Damage.Fire
    |                         ^^^^
 Why: a group names its whole subtree in patterns; an actual value is always a leaf variant (D-TAG1)
 Fix: pick a leaf: `Damage.Fire.Burn`, `Damage.Fire.Scald`
